<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Elandsrand to acquire Deelkraal.</title>
<headline>Elandsrand to acquire Deelkraal.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elandrand Gold Mining Company Limited (Elandsrand) and Deelkraal Gold Mining Company Limited (Deelkraal) said on Wednesday that Deelkraal would become a wholly-owned subsidiary of Elandsrand.</p>
<p>The groups said in a joint announcement the listings of Deelkraal shares on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange and the London Stock Exchange would be terminated.</p>
</text>
